{'symbol': 'PNC', 'date': '2022-08-16 11:05:00', 'title': "PNC BANK SIGNIFICANTLY EXPANDS SURCHAGE-FREE ATM ACCESS THROUGH NCR'S ALLPOINT NETWORK", 'text': 'PARTNERSHIP ADDS ACCESS TO MORE THAN 41,000 ATMS FOR PNC CUSTOMERS PITTSBURGH , AUG. 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PNC BANK ANNOUNCED TODAY A NEW PARTNERSHIP WITH NCR CORPORATION AND ITS ALLPOINT ATM NETWORK, PROVIDING CUSTOMERS WITH SURCHARGE-FREE ACCESS TO CASH THROUGH MORE THAN 41,000 MACHINES ACROSS THE UNITED STATES, INCLUDING HAWAII AND ALASKA. PNC CUSTOMERS NOW HAVE SURCHARGE-FREE ACCESS TO NEARLY 60,000 PNC BANK AND PNC PARTNER ATMS ACROSS THE COUNTRY.'}